.TH SIRBONE 1 "September 2026" "sir-bone-rs 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sirbone \- interactive AI coding agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sirbone
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sirbone
is an AI coding agent with streaming model responses, local tools, REPL and
terminal user-interface modes. Provider credentials and model settings are
read from its configuration and environment.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Display command help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Display version information.
.SH CONFIGURATION
See the packaged README and the project documentation for provider, model,
tool and MCP server configuration.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/sir-bone-rs/README.md.gz
Packaged usage and configuration documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://github.com/automataIA/sir-bone-rs
